WEBVTT

00:02:27.038 --> 00:02:31.246
We live in very strange times, but
I think for the most part,

00:02:31.413 --> 00:02:33.621
we all live in a state of constant rage.

00:02:33.996 --> 00:02:37.996
There's just too much information,
too much stuff to contend with.

00:02:38.704 --> 00:02:42.079
And so as a rule, we tend to default
to conventional wisdom.

00:02:43.079 --> 00:02:47.204
I think it's important that we ask
ourselves constantly how much of that

00:02:47.204 --> 00:02:53.121
conventional wisdom is all convention
and no wisdom and at what cost.

00:02:53.704 --> 00:02:56.371
As a writer myself, I think that there
is something really amazing here.

00:02:56.871 --> 00:03:00.204
Normally what makes a script hot is if
there's a huge celebrity attached